l,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["沒有過多的裝潢跟行銷，很簡單的呈現拉麵該有的味道，樸實好吃，湯頭濃郁但不膩，叉燒鮮甜軟\n柔軟保有肉香。叉燒飯是另一個經典，炙燒過的叉燒搭配美乃滋香氣誘人，醬汁拌勻在白飯上三兩口就可以扒光整碗，白飯口感偏軟，比較不是習慣的Q彈米粒口感。\n\n店員親切自然像鄰居般互動，整間店小巧舒適，感受得到店家的用心經營，雖然名氣不像台北許多拉麵名店一樣響亮，但論味道與品質完全不輸，價格方面更是實惠，算是淡水在地的寶藏店家之一。",null,[0,117]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15796596608402975125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUmxkSFNUSlNiazVYV2pOa1RVNXNUbHBsU0dSelZXNUNUbVZzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15796596608402975125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUmxkSFNUSlNiazVYV2pOa1RVNXNUbHBsU0dSelZXNUNUbVZzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15796596608402975125/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUmxkSFNUSlNiazVYV2pOa1RVNXNUbHBsU0dSelZXNUNUbVZzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15796596608402975125/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUmxkSFNUSlNiazVYV2pOa1RVNXNUbHBsU0dSelZXNUNUbVZzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15796596608402975125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUmxkSFNUSlNiazVYV2pOa1RVNXNUbHBsU0dSelZXNUNUbVZzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15796596608402975125/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUmxkSFNUSlNiazVYV2pOa1RVNXNUbHBsU0dSelZXNUNUbVZzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,9782,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aRldHSTJSbk5XWjNkTU5sTlplSGRzVW5CTmVsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7654a8529b23b61b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmZFWGI2RnNWZ3dMNlNZeHdsUnBNelE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aRldHSTJSbk5XWjNkTU5sTlplSGRzVW5CTmVsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aRldHSTJSbk5XWjNkTU5sTlplSGRzVW5CTmVsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aRldHSTJSbk5XWjNkTU5sTlplSGRzVW5CTmVsRRILMGNlbn